            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Clicking a chat under Open Questions no longer crashes Séance. Its answer boxes kept resizing each other while the side panel opened, until macOS stopped the app.

Claude chats started in a terminal now open on your phone and your other Macs even when they're idle. Before, a Mac that didn't have Séance's Claude hook installed showed "Preparing conversation…" for every idle chat.
]]></description>
